WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:01:36.590
[ Watch on KissFlix.co ]

2
01:36.860 --> 01:38.860
[The Lament of Autumn]

3
01:39.390 --> 01:41.830
[Episode 18]

4
01:57.650 --> 01:59.850
How long are you going to keep kneeling?

5
02:01.680 --> 02:03.060
It's been all night.

6
02:05.260 --> 02:07.260
Chanting the sutras a few more times

7
02:08.310 --> 02:09.910
will show the Bodhisattva

8
02:09.910 --> 02:11.520
how sincere I am.

9
02:12.680 --> 02:13.910
The Bodhisattva has seen it.

10
02:13.910 --> 02:14.650
Get up.

11
02:22.410 --> 02:24.030
Bodhisattva, please bless

12
02:24.060 --> 02:25.310
my Changxuan

13
02:25.960 --> 02:27.960
to return safely soon.

14
02:29.579 --> 02:31.750
He is the only boy in our family.

15
02:32.410 --> 02:34.210
His father went to war.

16
02:34.710 --> 02:36.460
His brother went to war.

17
02:37.460 --> 02:38.930
Sooner or later,

18
02:38.930 --> 02:40.560
he will have to face this day.

19
02:42.470 --> 02:44.750
I know you are his superior,

20
02:46.130 --> 02:48.130
the commander of the Yu Army.

21
02:50.470 --> 02:53.680
I am just a mother

22
02:55.370 --> 02:57.520
who only hopes her son

23
02:58.870 --> 03:01.500
can return safely soon.

24
03:27.250 --> 03:28.430
Keep up!

25
03:29.520 --> 03:30.190
Hurry!

26
03:31.630 --> 03:32.520
Run faster!

27
03:39.310 --> 03:40.210
Take cover!

28
03:40.690 --> 03:41.620
Take cover!

29
03:41.620 --> 03:44.280
Spread out!

30
03:46.000 --> 03:47.600
Protect the Army Commander!

31
03:49.120 --> 03:50.410
Hurry!

32
04:24.120 --> 04:24.720
Xuewu.

33
04:25.060 --> 04:26.120
Any bullets left?

34
04:26.150 --> 04:27.470
No, nothing left.

35
04:32.830 --> 04:34.120
They are out of bullets!

36
04:34.120 --> 04:35.470
Yu Zhongquan's son—

37
04:35.690 --> 04:37.150
we must capture him alive!

38
04:37.310 --> 04:38.120
By then,

39
04:38.180 --> 04:39.909
we will make Yu Zhongquan watch

40
04:40.310 --> 04:42.250
as we cut off his son's head!

41
04:42.930 --> 04:43.730
Fix bayonets!

42
04:43.810 --> 04:44.360
Yes!

43
05:41.370 --> 05:42.830
Scholar!

44
05:43.630 --> 05:44.430
Scholar!

45
05:44.560 --> 05:45.480
Scholar!

46
05:46.480 --> 05:47.060
Brother!

47
05:47.480 --> 05:48.040
Brother!

48
05:48.690 --> 05:49.130
Brother!

49
05:49.130 --> 05:49.690
Scholar!

50
05:50.890 --> 05:51.620
Scholar!

51
06:03.370 --> 06:04.180
This...

52
06:05.000 --> 06:06.560
You promised me.

53
06:07.420 --> 06:08.130
Scholar.

54
06:08.720 --> 06:11.720
I will definitely deliver your letter to your family!

55
06:19.560 --> 06:20.220
Brother...

56
06:22.060 --> 06:22.690
Go...

57
06:23.390 --> 06:23.890
Go!

58
06:23.980 --> 06:25.360
Let's go, Army Commander!

59
06:25.360 --> 06:26.510
Army Commander, let's go!

60
06:26.510 --> 06:27.430
Scholar!

61
06:27.810 --> 06:28.870
Retreat! Retreat!

62
07:16.250 --> 07:16.980
Yuan Huai!

63
07:18.870 --> 07:19.530
Brother!

64
07:19.870 --> 07:20.520
Brother!

65
07:24.770 --> 07:25.500
Brother!

66
07:31.430 --> 07:32.490
Army Commander...

67
07:33.390 --> 07:35.920
Make sure these get delivered.

68
07:46.890 --> 07:47.820
Army Commander.

69
07:50.430 --> 07:51.500
In our next lives,

70
07:53.190 --> 07:55.830
we must...

71
07:59.300 --> 08:00.270
grow...

72
08:02.070 --> 08:02.600
wheat...

73
08:04.500 --> 08:05.430
in Nanhuai City.

74
08:40.530 --> 08:47.320
♪ Mother, who knows how much you miss me? ♪

75
08:48.770 --> 08:55.150
♪ I dream of you, Mother, in my sleep ♪

76
08:56.480 --> 08:58.390
♪ Mother ♪

77
08:58.390 --> 08:59.460
Guan Bao!

78
09:04.390 --> 09:05.240
Guan Bao!

79
09:26.340 --> 09:27.510
Yu Changxuan is over there!

80
09:27.510 --> 09:28.290
Hurry!

81
09:58.440 --> 09:59.390
Get him!

82
09:59.780 --> 10:00.510
Changxuan!

83
10:01.750 --> 10:02.410
Changxuan!

84
10:08.890 --> 10:09.980
Their reinforcements are here!

85
10:09.980 --> 10:11.360
Retreat! Retreat!

86
10:38.530 --> 10:39.130
Xueting,

87
10:39.390 --> 10:40.250
it's been a long time

88
10:40.250 --> 10:42.110
since you came to pick up Pingjun.

89
10:42.500 --> 10:43.600
I've been busy lately.

90
10:43.600 --> 10:44.940
I have some free time today,

91
10:44.940 --> 10:46.050
so I'm taking her out for a meal.

92
10:46.050 --> 10:47.740
What a model boyfriend.

93
10:48.100 --> 10:48.730
Bye.

94
10:51.150 --> 10:52.290
I just passed by the garden

95
10:52.290 --> 10:53.820
and heard some officers say

96
10:53.890 --> 10:54.790
that Fifth Young Master Yu

97
10:54.790 --> 10:56.100
is trapped on the battlefield,

98
10:56.100 --> 10:57.200
out of ammunition and food,

99
10:57.200 --> 10:58.390
and his life is hanging by a thread.

100
10:58.390 --> 10:59.460
Fifth Young Master Yu is Commander Yu's

101
10:59.460 --> 11:00.530
only son.

102
11:00.550 --> 11:02.550
Nothing would happen to him, right?

103
11:03.200 --> 11:04.100
No one can predict

104
11:04.100 --> 11:05.100
what happens on the battlefield.

105
11:05.100 --> 11:06.290
Bullets don't discriminate.

106
11:06.290 --> 11:07.170
I heard

107
11:07.290 --> 11:09.050
they were ambushed

108
11:09.050 --> 11:10.850
and the enemy had heavy weapons.

109
11:11.100 --> 11:12.150
I'm afraid he may not

110
11:12.150 --> 11:13.290
make it back this time.

111
11:13.290 --> 11:14.030
Chances are,

112
11:14.030 --> 11:15.000
he's done for.

113
11:19.740 --> 11:20.440
Pingjun!

114
11:24.390 --> 11:25.290
Don't move.

115
11:25.290 --> 11:27.150
I'll get a broom and clean this up.

116
11:32.740 --> 11:33.940
You're bleeding.

117
11:34.050 --> 11:35.380
I'll get some medicine.

118
11:43.530 --> 11:44.060
Pingjun.

119
11:50.410 --> 11:51.940
What happened to your hand?

120
11:55.150 --> 11:55.890
I'm fine.

121
11:56.750 --> 11:59.000
I just got a little cut by accident.

122
12:00.440 --> 12:01.500
Let me bandage it for you.

123
12:01.500 --> 12:02.080
No need.

124
12:11.650 --> 12:13.000
I need to clean this up.

125
12:13.670 --> 12:14.440
And I need to find

126
12:14.440 --> 12:15.630
a new vase.

127
12:16.340 --> 12:17.010
Pingjun.

128
12:19.500 --> 12:20.840
I've already made it clear to her.

129
12:20.840 --> 12:21.730
She has gone back to Japan

130
12:21.730 --> 12:23.730
and won't come looking for me again.

131
12:26.550 --> 12:28.050
Don't you get it yet?

132
12:28.290 --> 12:30.220
What I really care about isn't her.

133
12:31.890 --> 12:32.690
It's that you lied to her

134
12:32.690 --> 12:33.960
and then hid it from me.

135
12:37.940 --> 12:39.530
You don't trust me at all.

136
12:41.390 --> 12:41.960
Nor do you trust

137
12:41.960 --> 12:43.620
the relationship between us.

138
13:04.470 --> 13:07.130
[Mingde Girls' High School Graduation Ceremony]

139
14:13.820 --> 14:16.660
[Chunfeng Troupe]

140
14:16.690 --> 14:19.770
[Chunfeng Troupe Repertoire]

141
14:40.580 --> 14:41.870
Charge!

142
14:49.120 --> 14:51.000
Charge!

143
14:52.950 --> 14:59.530
[Xing Newspaper]

144
15:21.460 --> 15:23.600
Kill them!

145
16:02.050 --> 16:05.660
[Luanjiang Gate]

146
16:13.790 --> 16:14.320
Hyah!

147
16:14.860 --> 16:15.290
Hyah!

148
16:15.310 --> 16:15.850
Hyah!

149
16:16.770 --> 16:17.130
Hyah!

150
16:19.170 --> 16:19.500
Hyah!

151
16:25.550 --> 16:28.220
[Luanjiang Gate]

152
16:38.210 --> 16:40.200
[Luanjiang Gate]

153
16:53.360 --> 16:54.220
Enter the city.

154
17:15.300 --> 17:17.660
[Luanjiang Gate]

155
18:01.740 --> 18:04.970
[Yu Mansion]

156
18:05.900 --> 18:06.750
Be gentle.

157
18:06.780 --> 18:07.350
Don't be so clumsy.

158
18:07.350 --> 18:09.140
[Grasping the Moon]

159
18:09.880 --> 18:10.940
Be careful, everyone.

160
18:10.940 --> 18:12.200
Don't break anything.

161
18:22.990 --> 18:24.720
Come here and let me take a look.

162
18:33.590 --> 18:34.400
Okay.

163
18:35.440 --> 18:37.270
The Fifth Young Master is returning victorious today.

164
18:37.270 --> 18:38.470
What wonderful news!

165
18:38.880 --> 18:41.270
Everyone, look sharp for tonight's family banquet.

166
18:41.270 --> 18:42.030
Yes.

167
18:59.920 --> 19:00.850
Well done!

168
19:00.850 --> 19:01.660
Mighty is the Yu Army!

169
19:01.660 --> 19:03.520
Well done, Fifth Young Master Yu!

170
19:04.540 --> 19:06.270
Mighty is the Yu Army!

171
19:20.720 --> 19:21.920
Well done!

172
19:25.200 --> 19:26.910
One black suit.

173
19:27.270 --> 19:27.700
Right.

174
19:27.720 --> 19:29.550
One navy blue mandarin jacket.

175
19:29.790 --> 19:30.480
Here.

176
19:30.640 --> 19:32.480
One light pink qipao.

177
19:32.570 --> 19:33.400
These three?

178
19:33.610 --> 19:33.940
Okay.

179
19:34.290 --> 19:36.150
Two pairs of white leather shoes.

180
19:36.440 --> 19:38.140
The streets were buzzing today.

181
19:38.140 --> 19:39.500
I think everyone in Nanhai

182
19:39.500 --> 19:40.420
went to the city gate

183
19:40.420 --> 19:42.070
to welcome the Yu Army returning in triumph.

184
19:42.070 --> 19:43.790
The Fifth Young Master Yu was so majestic.

185
19:43.790 --> 19:45.880
Just one look at him was enough to make your heart flutter.

186
19:45.880 --> 19:46.840
Look.

187
19:47.070 --> 19:48.240
He's all over

188
19:48.240 --> 19:50.120
the front page.

189
19:50.700 --> 19:52.890
"The Battle That Made Fifth Young Master Yu a National Hero:

190
19:52.890 --> 19:53.160
[Nanhuai Evening News]

191
19:53.160 --> 19:55.360
A Bloody Fightback

192
19:55.480 --> 19:57.690
and the Recapture of Luanjiang City"

193
19:58.080 --> 19:59.770
Fifth Young Master Yu is incredible.

194
19:59.770 --> 20:00.440
He sure is.

195
20:00.570 --> 20:01.550
The Fifth Young Master Yu is amazing.

196
20:01.550 --> 20:04.410
Absolutely. The Yu Army lives up to its reputation.

197
20:05.090 --> 20:06.040
Caizhi.

198
20:06.440 --> 20:07.400
I'm ready.

199
20:07.400 --> 20:08.560
Let's go.

200
20:09.480 --> 20:10.270
Pingjun.

201
20:10.290 --> 20:11.980
We need white leather shoes.

202
20:17.270 --> 20:18.070
Sorry.

203
20:19.750 --> 20:20.790
What's wrong?

204
20:21.330 --> 20:23.070
Are you feeling unwell?

205
20:26.200 --> 20:27.070
I'm fine.

206
20:27.740 --> 20:29.340
White leather shoes, right?

207
20:29.530 --> 20:30.240
Okay.

208
20:31.030 --> 20:31.900
Stop looking.

209
20:31.900 --> 20:33.180
Hurry up and organize the props.

210
20:33.180 --> 20:34.680
There are so many of them.

211
20:35.530 --> 20:36.660
Put this over there.

212
20:45.030 --> 20:45.980
Brothers!

213
20:47.030 --> 20:48.510
Yu Changxuan,

214
20:48.850 --> 20:51.440
Army Commander of the Yu Army's Ninth Army,

215
20:51.740 --> 20:54.400
led our forces to annihilate over 10,000 troops

216
20:54.400 --> 20:58.610
of the Qi Army in the Battle of Luanjiang

217
20:59.330 --> 21:01.500
and recapture the city!

218
21:02.140 --> 21:05.680
He is hereby awarded the First-Class Medal of Merit

219
21:07.180 --> 21:08.660
and appointed

220
21:09.350 --> 21:12.500
Deputy Commander-in-Chief of the Yu Army!

221
21:56.300 --> 21:57.510
[First-Class Medal of Merit]

222
22:06.330 --> 22:08.140
Greetings, Deputy Commander-in-Chief!

223
22:08.140 --> 22:09.660
Greetings, Deputy Commander-in-Chief!

224
22:09.660 --> 22:11.350
Greetings, Deputy Commander-in-Chief!

225
22:11.350 --> 22:13.680
Greetings, Deputy Commander-in-Chief!

226
22:41.440 --> 22:43.640
My son was on the battlefield for a year.

227
22:44.530 --> 22:45.500
Someone here has had him on his mind

228
22:45.500 --> 22:47.830
and talked about him constantly.

229
22:48.480 --> 22:50.240
Now that he's back,

230
22:50.260 --> 22:51.640
having distinguished himself in battle,

231
22:51.640 --> 22:52.570
this person

232
22:53.330 --> 22:55.390
can't even spare him a few kind words.

233
22:56.700 --> 22:58.100
Are you talking about me?

234
23:08.900 --> 23:09.700
Fine.

235
23:10.590 --> 23:11.400
I'll say it.

236
23:12.750 --> 23:14.410
You fought like a real soldier

237
23:16.070 --> 23:17.640
in the Battle of Luanjiang.

238
23:20.680 --> 23:21.590
That's it?

239
23:22.200 --> 23:23.380
This Commander-in-Chief

240
23:23.380 --> 23:24.940
is really a man of few words.

241
23:26.920 --> 23:27.350
Here.

242
23:28.180 --> 23:28.980
Changxuan.

243
23:30.090 --> 23:30.830
I heard

244
23:30.830 --> 23:32.590
that when they carried you back to camp,

245
23:32.590 --> 23:34.000
you were covered in blood.

246
23:34.000 --> 23:35.200
Your left arm was blown apart,

247
23:35.200 --> 23:36.400
with the bone exposed.

248
23:36.400 --> 23:37.940
You nearly lost your arm.

249
23:38.000 --> 23:38.980
It wasn't that bad.

250
23:38.980 --> 23:40.780
Don't listen to their nonsense.

251
23:41.750 --> 23:42.550
Changxuan.

252
23:43.770 --> 23:44.770
I think you should

253
23:44.980 --> 23:47.240
have a doctor examine you more thoroughly.

254
23:47.240 --> 23:48.700
I'm fine. I've recovered.

255
23:49.180 --> 23:50.890
My injuries are nothing

256
23:50.910 --> 23:52.040
on the battlefield.

257
23:53.740 --> 23:57.070
So many never made it home.

258
24:08.090 --> 24:10.290
Once you've chosen to be a soldier,

259
24:12.770 --> 24:14.900
you have to be ready to lay down your life.

260
24:14.900 --> 24:17.480
Once you take up a gun, you have to charge into battle.

261
24:17.480 --> 24:19.280
There's no room for hesitation.

262
24:23.590 --> 24:24.380
This time,

263
24:25.070 --> 24:27.250
Changxuan not only reclaimed the lost territory

264
24:27.250 --> 24:28.850
but also kept his cool and commanded his troops

265
24:28.850 --> 24:30.780
under fire despite being wounded,

266
24:30.920 --> 24:32.800
ultimately holding the line.

267
24:33.050 --> 24:34.660
His courage and fighting spirit

268
24:34.660 --> 24:35.900
not only struck fear into the enemy

269
24:35.900 --> 24:37.550
and earned him respect within the army,

270
24:37.550 --> 24:38.810
but also brought honor

271
24:38.920 --> 24:40.200
to the Yu Army.

272
24:41.850 --> 24:42.330
Dad,

273
24:42.980 --> 24:44.780
you can really rest assured now.

274
24:54.590 --> 24:55.590
Try this.

275
24:57.440 --> 24:58.640
As the saying goes,

276
24:59.030 --> 25:00.440
there are two great joys in life:

277
25:00.440 --> 25:02.640
passing the imperial exams and getting married.

278
25:02.640 --> 25:04.570
I'd say your triumphant return

279
25:04.570 --> 25:06.700
counts as passing with flying colors.

280
25:07.400 --> 25:08.900
So, when do you plan

281
25:09.070 --> 25:10.480
to hold the wedding?

282
25:10.790 --> 25:12.250
Should I find a fortune-teller

283
25:12.250 --> 25:13.330
to pick an auspicious date?

284
25:13.330 --> 25:13.740
Mom.

285
25:14.890 --> 25:16.980
I've only just returned from the battlefield,

286
25:16.980 --> 25:18.980
and there are still a lot of military affairs to take care of,

287
25:18.980 --> 25:20.300
especially matters

288
25:20.420 --> 25:23.020
concerning the fallen soldiers of the Yu Army.

289
25:23.140 --> 25:24.420
I want to see to

290
25:24.720 --> 25:26.530
their final arrangements myself.

291
25:26.530 --> 25:28.530
I'm afraid this isn't the right time

292
25:28.830 --> 25:30.030
to discuss marriage.

293
25:31.070 --> 25:32.260
Yes, yes.

294
25:32.570 --> 25:33.700
Well,

295
25:33.700 --> 25:34.900
I've been so caught up

296
25:34.900 --> 25:37.100
in wanting Ziyi as my daughter-in-law.

297
25:37.270 --> 25:39.140
You are more thoughtful.

298
25:39.530 --> 25:40.770
We shouldn't handle

299
25:41.070 --> 25:42.930
these two things at the same time.

300
25:45.290 --> 25:47.590
On the battlefield, bullets are flying everywhere,

301
25:47.590 --> 25:49.440
and lives are at stake.

302
25:49.940 --> 25:51.050
We should give Changxuan

303
25:51.050 --> 25:52.830
some time to recover.

304
25:53.090 --> 25:55.880
That way, I'll also have a chance to look after him

305
25:56.140 --> 25:57.330
and spend more time with him.

306
25:57.330 --> 25:58.050
Yes.

307
25:59.590 --> 26:00.650
Let's eat. Come on.

308
26:06.610 --> 26:15.330
[Yu Mansion]

309
26:21.350 --> 26:22.110
Ziyi.

310
26:25.000 --> 26:26.590
I have something to tell you.

311
26:26.590 --> 26:28.000
You just got back.

312
26:28.200 --> 26:29.330
You need a good rest.

313
26:29.940 --> 26:31.830
Besides, I promised my father

314
26:31.830 --> 26:33.680
I'd go back and help him take care of a few things today.

315
26:33.680 --> 26:34.700
I have to go now.

316
26:36.480 --> 26:37.200
Ziyi.

317
26:45.810 --> 26:48.390
[Yu Mansion]

318
26:55.830 --> 26:57.420
[Yu Mansion]

319
26:58.760 --> 27:00.540
[Yu Mansion]

320
27:19.060 --> 27:22.240
[Guanyin Pavilion]

321
27:28.620 --> 27:31.370
[In Memory of Sun Xuewu] [In Memory of He Dapeng]

322
27:32.900 --> 27:33.980
I'm waiting for you

323
27:33.980 --> 27:35.740
to announce to the entire army,

324
27:35.810 --> 27:37.110
"Sergeant Sun Xuewu

325
27:37.220 --> 27:37.700
has proven himself brave in battle and brilliant in strategy.

326
27:37.700 --> 27:39.770
[In Memory of Sun Xuewu] [In Memory of Xu Shaoxuan]

327
27:39.770 --> 27:42.970
He is hereby promoted to staff officer of the Ninth Army."

328
27:43.770 --> 27:44.430
Commander,

329
27:44.750 --> 27:45.770
actually, when you

330
27:45.770 --> 27:47.070
handed me this horse,

331
27:47.330 --> 27:48.860
I'd already made up my mind.

332
27:48.880 --> 27:49.570
The Yu Army is missing

333
27:49.570 --> 27:50.700
a cavalry unit.

334
27:51.030 --> 27:51.850
How about I train

335
27:51.850 --> 27:53.310
a cavalry company for you?

336
27:53.420 --> 27:54.590
As escorts,

337
27:54.640 --> 27:54.880
[In Memory of He Dapeng] [In Memory of Guan Bao]

338
27:54.880 --> 27:56.810
loyalty and honor are in our blood.

339
27:59.180 --> 28:00.420
When war breaks out,

340
28:01.270 --> 28:03.600
no one plants crops in the fields anymore.

341
28:04.030 --> 28:04.530
Instead, the fields are filled

342
28:04.530 --> 28:05.450
with the bodies of the dead.

343
28:05.450 --> 28:07.960
[In Memory of He Dapeng] [In Memory of Yuan Huai]

344
28:07.960 --> 28:14.480
♪ Mother, who knows how much you miss me? ♪

345
28:14.750 --> 28:16.070
[In Memory of Guan Bao]

346
28:16.070 --> 28:22.850
♪ I dream of you, Mother, in my sleep ♪

347
28:23.850 --> 28:28.850
♪ Mother, oh, Mother ♪

348
28:37.400 --> 28:38.010
Commander...

349
28:38.010 --> 28:39.310
[Mother, Mrs. Zhang]

350
28:39.310 --> 28:42.170
Make sure these get delivered.

351
28:51.010 --> 28:52.940
These are their farewell letters.

352
28:54.610 --> 28:55.530
Make sure to deliver them

353
28:55.530 --> 28:56.590
to their families.

354
29:08.030 --> 29:10.360
Find Guan Bao's mother as soon as possible

355
29:10.770 --> 29:13.370
and make sure she's provided for in her old age.

356
29:13.940 --> 29:15.000
He Dapeng's family

357
29:15.940 --> 29:16.530
must receive

358
29:16.530 --> 29:18.530
the same compensation as the family

359
29:19.110 --> 29:20.910
of a cavalry company commander.

360
29:21.310 --> 29:22.570
Find a plot of farmland

361
29:24.070 --> 29:26.200
in the suburbs for Yuan Huai's family.

362
29:28.050 --> 29:28.850
Changxuan,

363
29:29.310 --> 29:30.250
don't worry.

364
29:30.270 --> 29:32.000
We'll take care of everything.

365
29:32.030 --> 29:33.070
And Sun Xuewu...

366
29:33.880 --> 29:34.680
I know.

367
29:36.220 --> 29:38.070
I'll send an official letter to his family

368
29:38.070 --> 29:40.070
in the name of the staff department.

369
29:40.070 --> 29:41.600
I'll make sure to emphasize

370
29:42.980 --> 29:44.840
that he was a valued staff officer

371
29:46.140 --> 29:47.880
of the Ninth Army of the Yu Army.

372
29:52.680 --> 29:54.010
You two go get some rest.

373
29:55.220 --> 29:57.220
I'll stay with them a little longer.

374
30:22.770 --> 30:23.720
Japanese soldiers

375
30:23.720 --> 30:25.110
shot and killed two Changsha civilians,

376
30:25.110 --> 30:26.070
committing murder in broad daylight.

377
30:26.070 --> 30:27.180
Protests and demonstrations

378
30:27.180 --> 30:28.620
have erupted across the country, led primarily

379
30:28.620 --> 30:29.740
by workers and students.

380
30:29.740 --> 30:31.410
Director Liang and Ruoru will focus on

381
30:31.410 --> 30:33.150
contacting Nanhai's Federation of Trade Unions,

382
30:33.150 --> 30:34.980
the Student Union, and the Patriotic Weekly

383
30:34.980 --> 30:36.610
to publish anti-Japanese articles.

384
30:36.610 --> 30:37.540
As for us,

385
30:37.560 --> 30:39.310
we'll focus on putting on performances around Nanhai.

386
30:39.310 --> 30:40.350
Our main message will be

387
30:40.350 --> 30:41.880
to boycott Japanese goods.

388
30:41.880 --> 30:43.400
The Japanese are simply lawless.

389
30:43.400 --> 30:44.660
They have gone too far.

390
30:44.700 --> 30:45.850
We must do our part.

391
30:47.220 --> 30:48.810
We'll work separately.

392
30:48.810 --> 30:49.920
I'll write the scripts,

393
30:49.920 --> 30:51.240
and you find venues.

394
30:51.330 --> 30:51.950
We'll try

395
30:51.980 --> 30:53.400
to coordinate our performances

396
30:53.400 --> 30:54.860
with the protest marches.

397
30:56.460 --> 30:56.830
Look!

398
30:56.980 --> 30:57.420
Deputy Commander-in-Chief Yu is here!

399
30:57.420 --> 30:59.440
Deputy Commander-in-Chief Yu returned in triumph.

400
30:59.440 --> 31:01.480
All officers and soldiers are invited to enjoy the opera.

401
31:01.480 --> 31:03.280
Deputy Commander-in-Chief Yu.

402
31:43.160 --> 31:47.950
[Xiangxi Hotel]

403
31:49.090 --> 31:49.790
Officers.

404
31:49.790 --> 31:51.420
I'm the troupe leader.

405
31:51.460 --> 31:52.740
Fifth Young Master Yu has instructed me

406
31:52.740 --> 31:54.840
to arrange whatever plays

407
31:55.000 --> 31:56.000
you'd like to see.

408
31:56.000 --> 31:57.530
What are you talking about?

409
32:00.160 --> 32:01.400
Deputy Commander-in-Chief Yu.

410
32:01.400 --> 32:02.750
Deputy Commander-in-Chief Yu.

411
32:02.750 --> 32:03.550
Deputy Commander-in-Chief Yu.

412
32:03.550 --> 32:04.350
Deputy Commander-in-Chief Yu.

413
32:04.350 --> 32:05.460
Deputy Commander-in-Chief Yu.

414
32:05.460 --> 32:06.460
Please, don't stand on ceremony.

415
32:06.460 --> 32:08.320
Just sit back and enjoy the opera.

416
32:14.660 --> 32:15.320
Commander,

417
32:15.540 --> 32:17.240
what would you like to see today?

418
32:17.240 --> 32:18.110
The usual.

419
32:18.250 --> 32:18.850
You got it.

420
32:23.720 --> 32:26.650
[Resounding Arias]

421
33:01.380 --> 33:03.780
It's all thanks to the brother's hard work.

422
33:19.850 --> 33:20.660
You've seen Dingjun Mountain

423
33:20.660 --> 33:21.550
so many times.

424
33:21.550 --> 33:22.640
How are you still so engrossed?

425
33:22.640 --> 33:24.030
If you don't like it,

426
33:24.200 --> 33:25.530
go do your own business.

427
33:25.660 --> 33:26.960
What I mean is,

428
33:27.000 --> 33:28.680
don't spend all your time watching the opera.

429
33:28.680 --> 33:30.040
Why don't you go see the woman

430
33:30.040 --> 33:31.570
you've been longing to see?

431
33:35.400 --> 33:37.600
Miss Ye is upstairs on the second floor.

432
33:44.200 --> 33:45.060
What do you say?

433
33:45.250 --> 33:47.030
Are you going up to see her yourself,

434
33:47.030 --> 33:49.120
or should I bring her down?

435
33:49.400 --> 33:50.830
Why should I go up?

436
33:54.240 --> 33:55.200
Stubborn, aren't you?

437
33:55.200 --> 33:55.790
Fine.

438
33:55.940 --> 33:58.270
I might as well play the good guy to the end.

439
33:58.350 --> 33:59.850
I'll go invite her down.

440
34:19.590 --> 34:20.280
Miss Ye.

441
34:20.710 --> 34:21.300
How long have you been

442
34:21.300 --> 34:21.900
peeking at our Fifth Young Master Yu

443
34:21.900 --> 34:22.760
from here?

444
34:25.400 --> 34:27.260
I rarely

445
34:27.260 --> 34:28.530
see you

446
34:28.530 --> 34:30.500
flustered like this.

447
34:35.340 --> 34:37.460
I just happen to have a few words of thanks

448
34:37.460 --> 34:39.190
to say to Fifth Young Master Yu.

449
34:39.670 --> 34:40.850
Isn't that perfect?

450
34:41.000 --> 34:41.980
They say when fate brings two people together,

451
34:41.980 --> 34:43.010
there's no escaping it.

452
34:43.010 --> 34:43.920
You two just happened to run into each other

453
34:43.920 --> 34:44.820
at the theater.

454
34:44.900 --> 34:45.900
If you have anything private to say,

455
34:45.900 --> 34:47.260
you can say it to his face.

456
34:47.260 --> 34:48.460
Otherwise, how would he know?

457
34:48.460 --> 34:48.980
Right?

458
34:49.760 --> 34:50.110
Come.

459
34:52.530 --> 34:53.130
Come on.

460
35:04.610 --> 35:05.300
Miss Ye.

461
35:07.310 --> 35:09.310
Sit down and watch the opera with us.

462
35:12.920 --> 35:13.400
Fifth Young Master Yu.

463
35:13.400 --> 35:14.000
Boren.

464
35:15.000 --> 35:18.400
The actor playing Huang Zhong is doing a fine job. Reward him.

465
35:33.510 --> 35:34.860
Okay, I'll go.

466
35:35.050 --> 35:35.810
Also...

467
35:37.300 --> 35:39.270
Don't bring irrelevant people

468
35:39.610 --> 35:40.900
in front of me anymore.

469
35:52.090 --> 35:54.230
Sorry to bother you.

470
35:54.940 --> 35:55.960
I'll be off now.

471
35:59.360 --> 36:00.050
Miss Ye.

472
36:00.530 --> 36:01.230
Miss Ye!

473
36:11.300 --> 36:12.860
Why did you have to say that?

474
36:12.860 --> 36:13.960
You obviously care about her

475
36:13.960 --> 36:15.100
very much.

476
36:15.730 --> 36:16.440
Remember.

477
36:18.190 --> 36:19.210
Don't mention her name

478
36:19.210 --> 36:20.340
in front of me again.

479
36:21.150 --> 36:22.300
I don't want to hear

480
36:22.300 --> 36:23.430
anything about her.

481
36:43.590 --> 36:44.860
This time, Fifth Young Master Yu

482
36:44.860 --> 36:47.900
has really distinguished himself in battle and won people's hearts.

483
36:47.900 --> 36:50.190
I think his position as his father's successor

484
36:50.190 --> 36:52.620
is now quite secure.

485
36:53.940 --> 36:54.940
Before, so many people

486
36:54.940 --> 36:56.940
were flattering Kuang Bingwen,

487
36:57.340 --> 37:00.840
thinking this son-in-law could hold the fort alone.

488
37:01.860 --> 37:02.860
Now that

489
37:03.900 --> 37:07.590
they've realized that they've chosen the wrong side,

490
37:09.260 --> 37:10.050
I'm afraid

491
37:11.050 --> 37:13.090
they're regretting it bitterly.

492
37:14.780 --> 37:17.040
With Fifth Young Master Yu taking power,

493
37:17.090 --> 37:19.070
the one who resents it the most

494
37:19.260 --> 37:21.120
must be Brigade Commander Kuang.

495
37:21.960 --> 37:24.230
After working like a horse for so many years,

496
37:24.230 --> 37:25.210
a son-in-law

497
37:25.400 --> 37:27.190
is still an outsider, after all.

498
37:27.190 --> 37:28.820
In the end, he's just a stepping stone

499
37:28.820 --> 37:30.480
for the Commander's real son.

500
37:31.500 --> 37:32.760
You can say that again.

501
37:33.340 --> 37:35.820
This ideal son-in-law, in the end,

502
37:35.900 --> 37:39.260
is still just a dog that isn't allowed at the table.

503
37:39.510 --> 37:40.280
Exactly.

504
37:44.000 --> 37:45.650
We should go in.

505
37:45.900 --> 37:47.400
I wonder if Taochun

506
37:47.400 --> 37:49.050
is out yet.

507
37:49.050 --> 37:50.340
Let's go take a look.

508
37:53.210 --> 37:54.760
B-Brigade Commander Kuang.

509
37:54.760 --> 37:56.220
Brigade Commander Kuang.

510
37:56.940 --> 37:58.670
It's a good thing I ran into you.

511
37:59.900 --> 38:02.560
Brigade Commander Kuang, what can we do for you?

512
38:03.360 --> 38:04.890
I had a bit too much to drink.

513
38:05.110 --> 38:06.230
I want to go back.

514
38:06.650 --> 38:07.690
My car is parked

515
38:07.690 --> 38:08.840
in the alley ahead.

516
38:09.110 --> 38:11.610
Could you two help me over there?

517
38:12.860 --> 38:13.260
Here.

518
38:13.260 --> 38:14.460
This way, Commander.

519
38:21.980 --> 38:23.030
Brigade Commander Kuang.

520
38:23.030 --> 38:24.510
Where is your car?

521
38:25.340 --> 38:25.960
Yeah.

522
38:26.880 --> 38:27.880
Where is your car?

523
38:43.590 --> 38:44.210
Kneel.

524
38:46.380 --> 38:47.760
Brigade Commander Kuang...

525
38:47.760 --> 38:48.630
Spare my life.

526
38:50.050 --> 38:51.360
Was it you just now

527
38:52.360 --> 38:53.820
who said I was a dog?

528
39:15.320 --> 39:16.570
Bite down hard.

529
40:38.960 --> 40:40.110
There were so many people

530
40:40.110 --> 40:41.770
congratulating you tonight.

531
40:41.980 --> 40:43.280
I didn't even have a chance

532
40:43.280 --> 40:44.940
to have a drink with you alone.

533
40:47.420 --> 40:47.920
Here.

534
41:05.960 --> 41:07.220
You've had your drink,

535
41:07.840 --> 41:09.370
but you're still frowning.

536
41:11.230 --> 41:12.560
This celebratory drink

537
41:13.500 --> 41:14.700
doesn't taste right?

538
41:17.670 --> 41:18.640
Celebratory...

539
41:20.380 --> 41:21.500
I used to think

540
41:21.520 --> 41:22.450
I was omnipotent

541
41:24.070 --> 41:25.800
and could control everything.

542
41:26.820 --> 41:28.070
But when I actually went to the battlefield,

543
41:28.070 --> 41:29.090
I realized

544
41:30.280 --> 41:32.010
how little was actually within

545
41:33.170 --> 41:34.420
my control.

546
41:39.320 --> 41:40.780
Those soldiers trusted me

547
41:43.280 --> 41:45.080
and entrusted their lives to me,

548
41:48.920 --> 41:50.650
but I couldn't bring them back.

549
41:53.840 --> 41:55.100
As long as there is war,

550
41:56.900 --> 41:58.300
there will be tragedies.

551
42:04.960 --> 42:07.530
Stopping war with war isn't ideal,

552
42:09.000 --> 42:10.260
but there's no denying

553
42:12.550 --> 42:13.690
that it's a way to achieve

554
42:13.690 --> 42:14.890
peace and stability.

555
42:17.480 --> 42:18.650
But since I was a child, I've watched my father

556
42:18.650 --> 42:19.900
and those uncles

557
42:20.840 --> 42:22.070
fight tooth and nail

558
42:23.070 --> 42:24.300
for power and profit.

559
42:26.150 --> 42:28.610
After bloody battles and countless deaths,

560
42:29.130 --> 42:32.130
the generals on both sides shook hands and made peace.

561
42:33.300 --> 42:35.030
But the sons of those mothers

562
42:37.690 --> 42:39.070
could never return.

563
42:43.690 --> 42:44.840
What is the meaning

564
42:47.650 --> 42:48.760
of such a war?

565
42:51.260 --> 42:52.380
You're right.

566
42:53.530 --> 42:54.760
War can stop violence

567
42:55.590 --> 42:57.790
and resist aggression and atrocities.

568
42:58.880 --> 42:59.940
But a civil war,

569
43:00.690 --> 43:02.860
where Chinese people of the same nation

570
43:02.860 --> 43:03.960
kill each other,

571
43:06.840 --> 43:08.840
is an absolute tragedy.

572
43:20.960 --> 43:23.560
People who just came back from the battlefield

573
43:24.650 --> 43:27.050
mostly have a murderous look in their eyes.

574
43:27.690 --> 43:29.890
But in your eyes, Fifth Young Master Yu,

575
43:30.230 --> 43:31.610
I see compassion.

576
43:34.050 --> 43:36.250
An iron fist can forge a fierce general.

577
43:37.030 --> 43:39.290
But only benevolence and righteousness

578
43:40.360 --> 43:41.440
can make

579
43:43.130 --> 43:46.460
a good general who protects the people and brings peace to the world.

580
43:46.460 --> 43:47.150
Jin.

581
43:49.860 --> 43:51.660
Why do I feel like you're talking

582
43:53.010 --> 43:54.540
to someone else through me?

583
43:55.840 --> 43:56.970
Fifth Young Master.

584
43:58.360 --> 43:59.690
You've changed.

585
44:00.800 --> 44:01.570
How so?

586
44:04.840 --> 44:06.170
You're just different.

587
44:58.800 --> 45:00.060
You're not asleep yet?

588
45:00.900 --> 45:01.960
I was just about to.

589
45:10.360 --> 45:12.490
Does it have to be like this every time?

590
45:12.590 --> 45:13.940
Every time I come back from the battlefield,

591
45:13.940 --> 45:15.530
barely making it back alive,

592
45:15.530 --> 45:17.380
you remain completely indifferent.

593
45:17.380 --> 45:20.590
It seems that whether I live or die,

594
45:21.630 --> 45:22.550
your heart

595
45:23.780 --> 45:25.570
won't even skip a beat.

596
45:26.550 --> 45:28.190
You know I don't like drunks.

597
45:39.050 --> 45:40.500
At the gathering today,

598
45:41.150 --> 45:42.610
they took turns toasting.

599
45:43.530 --> 45:45.070
I drank too much.

600
45:45.900 --> 45:47.340
I don't even know

601
45:48.230 --> 45:49.430
when I got scratched.

602
45:51.820 --> 45:54.460
A battle-hardened man like you, Brigade Commander Kuang,

603
45:54.460 --> 45:55.650
can get hurt?

604
45:56.550 --> 45:59.550
You should be more careful in the future.

605
46:06.260 --> 46:07.340
Aren't you curious

606
46:09.090 --> 46:10.500
about what I did outside?

607
46:13.150 --> 46:14.500
As long as you keep being

608
46:14.500 --> 46:16.360
the Yu family's good son-in-law,

609
46:16.860 --> 46:18.730
I won't look into anything

610
46:19.650 --> 46:21.190
you don't want me to see.

611
46:42.630 --> 46:47.340
[Yu Mansion]
